# DRAW keymap preset: Aseprite  (SAFEST — only DRAW-free target keys remapped)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt.  Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# Policy (Rick, "safest"): applied ONLY if the target key is UNBOUND in DRAW. Collisions
# are documented, not applied — decide them in PLANS/PRESETS-KEYMAP-DECISIONS.md.
#
# Aseprite is the closest match: B pencil, E eraser, L line, M marquee, I eyedropper,
# T text, Z zoom, V move, H/V flips — DRAW already agrees on almost all of these.

# --- Safe remaps (target key free in DRAW: Ctrl+I/J/K/U/W) ---
# Aseprite's distinctive ops (G bucket, U rectangle, C contour) all target keys that
# collide or are chord-risky in DRAW; nothing is provably safe. (none)

# --- COLLISIONS (need a decision; NOT applied) -------------------------------
#   G   Paint Bucket (fill) -> DRAW G is a grid chord initiator; DRAW Fill is F
#   U   Rectangle           -> DRAW U free-ish (chord letter); DRAW Rect is R
#   C   Contour / Ellipse   -> DRAW C is Ellipse (partial match) but Aseprite C=contour
#   D   Brush size cycle    -> DRAW D is Dot tool
#   P   Colour picker       -> DRAW P is Polygon; DRAW picker is I (match on I)
#   F   Fill (contiguous)   -> DRAW F is Fill (match)
#   N   (n/a)               -> free
#   Aseprite matches DRAW on B/E/L/M/I/T/Z/V — no rows needed for those.
